Output assets/gh-cleaner-show.gif

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1184
Set Height 602
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Shell "bash"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Sleep 1s

Type "./gh-cleaner -h"
Sleep 200ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type@50ms "clear"
Sleep 100ms
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type@50ms "./gh-cleaner --dry-run --forks"
Sleep 200ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
